# GrantFlow dApp — local env template. Copy to .env for local dev only.
# NEVER commit a real .env with secrets; this file holds no secrets.
#
# WalletConnect (optional): a free Reown Cloud project ID enables the
# WalletConnect option in the wallet chooser (QR on desktop, deep links on
# phone). Without it the build still succeeds and the chooser shows
# WalletConnect as "not set up yet" with the injected wallets still working.
# How to get one (free, ~2 minutes):
#   1. Go to https://cloud.reown.com and sign in (or create a free account).
#   2. Create a new project (any name, e.g. "GrantFlow").
#   3. Copy the Project ID from the project dashboard.
#   4. In Vercel: project grantflow → Settings → Environment Variables →
#      add VITE_WC_PROJECT_ID = <the project ID> (Production), then redeploy.
#      Or for local dev: put it in a local .env file as below.
#   5. Do NOT paste anyone else's project ID and do NOT invent one.
# VITE_WC_PROJECT_ID=
